<title>USA: Mass. $25 mln deal repriced, 5.75 pct top yield.</title>
<headline>Mass. $25 mln deal repriced, 5.75 pct top yield.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it repriced Massachustetts Industrial Finance Agency's $25.4 million Babson College deal. The top yield was 5.75 percent in 2027.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>Massachustetts Industrial Finance Agency</p>
<p>RE: $25,420,000*</p>
<p>Revenue Bonds, Babson College Issue, Series 1997A</p>
<p>Verbal award.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: A3		  S&amp;P: NAF</p>
<p>    1997 - 2008   MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 01/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1997  MBIA	  355M    3.75  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/1998  MBIA	  370M    4.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/1999  MBIA	  385M    4.10  %	  4.20</p>
<p>10/01/2000  MBIA	  400M    4.30  %	  4.40</p>
<p>10/01/2001  MBIA	  420M    4.40  %	  4.50</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2002  MBIA	  440M    4.50  %	  4.60</p>
<p>10/01/2003  MBIA	  460M    4.60  %	  4.70</p>
<p>10/01/2004  MBIA	  485M    4.70  %	  4.80</p>
<p>10/01/2005  MBIA	  505M    4.80  %	  4.90</p>
<p>10/01/2006  MBIA	  535M    5.75  %	  5.00</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2007  MBIA	  560M    5.75  %	  5.10</p>
<p>10/01/2008  MBIA	  590M    5.10  %	  5.20</p>
<p>10/01/2017		7,000M    5.375 %	  5.65</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 96.658)</p>
<p>10/01/2027	     12,915M    5.25  %	  5.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 92.82 )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 10/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, December 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on January 15, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
